# GrokBuild project

SwiftPM windowed macOS app — UI for `grok agent stdio`, not a replacement for the CLI.

## Key facts

- Canonical worktree/remote/retired-line identity: `CANONICAL_WORKTREE.md` (run its preflight first).
- Version: `VERSION` file → `AppVersion.display`.
- Installed provenance: `AppBuildIdentity` reads the repository, branch, commit, channel, and dirty state stamped into `Info.plist` by `scripts/build-identity.sh`.
- Build: `make run`, `make test`, `make app`, `make release` (see `BUILDING.md`).
- Full reference: `ARCHITECTURE.md`, agent entry: `AGENTS.md`.

## When editing

- Keep changes focused; reuse existing services and notification names.
- Stop if the worktree is the retired `/Users/jimmyschmitz/Documents/Grok Builf` line.
- Do not add an Xcode project; stay on SwiftPM + Makefile scripts.
- Brand mark: `GrokBuild/Resources/Assets.xcassets/MenuBarIcon.imageset/` (legacy imageset name).
- **Docs + tests + Computer Use required** with every code change — see `.cursor/rules/docs-and-tests.mdc`.
- Only commit when the user explicitly asks.

